                    <li>Attempt to reverse engineer, decompile, disassemble, or otherwise derive the source code of the Platform.</li>
                    <li>Circumvent, disable, or interfere with any security features or access controls of the Platform.</li>
                    <li>Use automated scripts, bots, crawlers, or similar tools to access or scrape data from the Platform without prior written consent.</li>
                    <li>Upload, transmit, or distribute any malicious code, viruses, or harmful software.</li>
                    <li>Impersonate another user, person, or entity, or falsely represent your affiliation with any person or entity.</li>
