                </ul>
                <p>We do not claim ownership of your User Content. However, we reserve the right to remove or disable access to any User Content that violates these Terms of Use or is otherwise objectionable, without prior notice.</p>

                <h3>6. Account Responsibilities</h3>
                <p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality and security of your account credentials. You agree to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Keep your login credentials secure and not share them with any unauthorised person.</li>
