                    <li>Log out of your account when using shared or public devices.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account if we reasonably believe that your credentials have been compromised or that your account is being used in violation of these Terms of Use.</p>

                <h3>7. Third-Party Links &amp; Services</h3>
                <p>The Platform may contain links to third-party websites, services, or resources that are not owned or controlled by us. We provide these links for convenience only and do not endorse or assume responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party sites or services.</p>
