                </ul>
                <p>Your use of the Platform is at your sole risk. You are responsible for ensuring that your use of the Platform complies with all applicable laws and regulations in your jurisdiction.</p>

                <h3>10. Contact</h3>
                <p>If you have any questions or concerns about these Terms of Use, or if you wish to report a violation of these terms, please contact us at:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@3inventors.com">privacy@3inventors.com</a></li>
                    <li>Company: 3 Inventors</li>
                    <li>Location: Nicosia, Cyprus</li>
